@BackendApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5188
@token = your-jwt-token-here

### Weather Forecast Test
GET {{BackendApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Register New Account (Local)
POST {{BackendApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "0901234567",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!",
  "address": "123 Nguyen Hue, TPHCM"
}

###

### Login with Email and Password
POST {{BackendApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Google Login
POST {{BackendApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/google-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "YOUR_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_HERE"
}

###

### Get Current User (Protected - Requires JWT Token)
GET {{BackendApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Forgot Password
POST {{BackendApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "0901234567",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

###
